sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Blade Page
    participant L as Laravel PythonDataService
    participant P as FastAPI
    participant D as MySQL
    B->>L: request recommendations or analytics
    L->>P: HTTP with X-Service-Token
    P->>D: read products/bookings/availability
    P-->>L: JSON result
    L-->>B: cached result
    L-->>B: fallback when timeout/error
